libgudev
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This gem contains no extension and no copied source. The whole binding is
GObjectIntrospection::Loader reading `GUdev-1.0.typelib` at require time and
defining the GUdev namespace from what it finds there; the shared library the
typelib names is the one already installed on the user's system, and the
`gobject-introspection` gem opens it at runtime. libgudev is GNOME's GObject
wrapper over libudev.

