--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ruby-gnome
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`GUdev::Loader` is modelled on ruby-gnome's own loaders -- gtksourceview5's for
a library that needs an init call, libsecret's for one that does not -- and the
`gobject-introspection` and `glib2` gems it builds on come from the same
project. They are runtime dependencies rather than vendored code.

