glib
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

GUdev-1.0.typelib names GObject-2.0 as its one dependency, so GLib and GObject
are loaded alongside it and are what every type here is built on. They are
LGPL-2.1-or-later system libraries too, and the paragraph above applies to them
unchanged.

